<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Star Telecommunications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Star Telecommunications.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist Tuesday said it started coverage of Star Telecommunications Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said the company is well-positioned in the market for international long distance telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings at $0.35 a share on sales of $337.2 million and 1998 earnings of $0.65 a share on sales of $482.6 million.</p>
<p>-- Star priced its initial public stock offering on June 12 at $9.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Star shares were up 1 at 14-1/2 by midday.</p>
</text>
